<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079033/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079034" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice> Viro
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Pergrat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> mihi fuerunt <choice><abbr>eruditiss.<hi rend="sup"><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>eruditissim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></expan></choice> tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515152305501" type="letter">liter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs>, quas ante quin<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>decim dies accepi. In illis enim humanissimas responsiones
      <lb/>ad meas qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stiones, et quidem sublimioribus doctrinis re<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>fertas inveni. Libentissime ergo in illis acquiesco. Scio,
      <lb/>me nimis frequenter Tibi Vir Amicissime esse mo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lestum meis iisque multis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stionibus; sed inte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rim spero, cum Tibi tempus minimum supererit,
      <lb/>responsionem aliquam daturum esse postrem<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="B_991170515152405501" type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> mensis Junii, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> ut difficultatem dilue<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>res contra Hydrometrarum regulam de Liquorum
      <lb/>fluentium velocitatibus canalium sectionibus reci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>procis, rogabam, atque etiamnum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so.</p>
  <p><rs type="letter">Literas</rs> Chirurgi vestri Senatori Amplissimo D. Vincen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tio Grimani, qui tormentorum bellicorum rei pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>est, communicavi. Aliquam difficultatem ille cum
      <lb/>ultis Illustribus Amicis agnoscit in executione
      <lb/>eorum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> promittit Chirurgus. Qua enim ratio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne tempore 60 minutorum fieri possint 400 jac<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tus (quod promittit Chirurgus) intellectu durum
      <lb/>videtur propter executionis difficultatem. Rem
      <lb/>eandem im<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> ampliorem promisit <choice><abbr>Sereniss.</abbr><expan>Serenissim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></expan></choice>
      <lb/>Nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Reipublic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-115602194" type="person">Coronelli</rs>, qui parvi h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c penditur.
<pb facs="1079035" n="2"/>
      <lb/>Propter tuam meamque commendationem per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mittit ipse <choice><abbr>Illustr.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimus</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimus</expan></choice> Grimanus ut veniant
      <lb/>istius Chirurgi Amici in hanc nostram Urbem, faciant<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que suis sumtibus experimenta: qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> si succe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dent, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter sumtus, <choice><abbr>Sereniss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>Serenissima</expan></choice> <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Reipublica</rs> {*} pacto
      <lb/>pretio, generose persolvet. C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terum Chirurgum
      <lb/>ipsum meo nomine ut salutes rogo ipsique
      <lb/>dicas impossibile esse ut <choice><abbr>Sereniss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>Serenissima</expan></choice> h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Respu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>blica</rs> mittat istuc Ministros ad experimenta
      <lb/>facienda quum id nunquam facere consueverit.
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Celeberr.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimus</expan></choice> Agnatus Tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> ante duos dies ve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nit in <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>des meas, mecumque spero longo tempore
      <lb/>commorabitur hisce vacationibus: quare si ad ips<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>scribere voles, meis litteris<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Johann kann ein Schreiben an seinen Neffen Nicolaus I Bernoulli seiner Post an Michelotti beilegen. Nicolaus ist bei Michelotti in Venedig zu Gast.</note> illas, quas ad eum mit<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tere voles includere poteris.</p> <closer><salute>Quod reliquum est
      <lb/>plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m vale Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> meisque conatibus
      <lb/>favere perge.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1718-08-05">5 Augusti 1718</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p>S. P. mitto Filio tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicolao</rs> omni virtutum
        <lb/>genere Ornatissimo mihique Carissimo.
        <lb/>Operam dabo ut Patavium vocetur <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Dominus</expan></choice>
        <lb/><choice><abbr>Joh.</abbr><expan>Johannes</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-120379260" type="person">Scheuzerus</rs>, qui in pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentiarum promoveri
<pb facs="1079036" n="3"/>
        <lb/>non potest eo quia unus<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089586175" type="person">Francesco Soranzo</rs>. Johannes Scheuchzer nennt ihn in seinen Briefen an Johann I Bernoulli vom <rs key="B_991170515084505501" type="letter">24. Juli</rs> und <rs key="B_991170515084205501" type="letter">4. September 1718</rs> ausdrücklich als Gegner seiner Berufung. Im zweiten Schreiben kündigt er die Ablösung Soranzos durch <rs key="pers_DE-588-1111043582" type="person">Alvise Pisani</rs> im Oktober an. Pisani trat das Amt des Riformatore am 13. Oktober 1718 an.</note> ex <choice><abbr>Ill.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimis</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089922930 pers_DE-588-1089586175 pers_DE-588-1089586140" type="person">Mo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deratoribus</rs> alium Virum promovere vellet.
        <lb/>Post mensem et dimidium ille qui contrarius
        <lb/>est <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Domino</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-120379260" type="person">Scheuzero</rs> <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> Magistratu discedet, atque
        <lb/>in eius locum subintrabit alius N. Vir <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci
        <lb/>Procurator, apud quem me rem conficere sine
        <lb/>dubio spero.</p></postscript>
<pb facs="1079037" n="4"/>
  <closer><address><addrLine>A Monsieur</addrLine>
      <addrLine>Monsieur Jean Bernoulli</addrLine>
      <addrLine>Docteur en Medecine et Professeur tres</addrLine>
      <addrLine>Celebre de Matematique</addrLine>
      <addrLine><note type="postal">franco per <rs key="place_GEO-2775220" type="place">Insprug</rs></note>
      à Basle</addrLine></address></closer>
</div></body></text></TEI>